## Key Concepts

- Event Hubs throughput and backpressure
- Durable Functions orchestration patterns
- Azure ML scoring latency and scaling
- Cosmos DB per-tenant isolation and consistency
- Purview data governance and tagging
- DLQ, retries, auditing, and cross-region compliance

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo-DnD orchestrator (Durable Functions)
module.exports = async function(context) {
  const event = context.df.getInput();
  const score = await context.df.callActivity('MLInfer', event);
  await context.df.callActivity('CosmosUpsert', { tenant: event.tenant, score });
  context.df.setCustomStatus(`scored:${score}`);
  return score;
}
